      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs --output-dir \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/wezterm/colors\" -O \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/wezterm/main/living-code-{night,frost,paper,signal}.toml\"\n```\n\nThen select the scheme in `wezterm.lua`:\n\n```lua\nconfig.color_scheme = \"Living Code Night\"\n```",
      "configuration": "See [WezTerm's documentation](https://wezterm.org) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
